       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Details of the outcome or action resulting from the activity.  The reference to an \"event\" resource, such as Procedure or Encounter or Observation, is the result/outcome of the activity itself.  The activity can be conveyed using CarePlan.activity.detail OR using the CarePlan.activity.reference (a reference to a “request” resource)." ] ;
